# The Rust build tree and Next's build cache are large and useless to the build
# server: `target/` alone is 1.6 GB and pushed the deployment over Vercel's
# 100 MB upload limit. Neither is needed — CI builds the contract from source,
# and Vercel builds the app itself.
target/
**/target/
.next/
**/.next/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# Generated video frames and rendered output. The committed MP4 under artifacts/
# is what matters; the intermediate files are not.
scripts/pitch/out/
scripts/pitch/shots/

# Secrets never belong in a deployment bundle.
.env.local
**/.env.local
.env*.local